QUERY NAME: qryVetHoursAct
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW TimeCostCalcsMAP.WorkGroup, TimeCostCalcsMAP.Project AS ParentProject, Sum(TimeCostCalcsMAP.Time) AS SumOfHours
FROM TimeCostCalcsMAP
WHERE ((TimeCostCalcsMAP.Month<=[Forms]![frmPactReportMenu]![PeriodPick]))
GROUP BY TimeCostCalcsMAP.WorkGroup, TimeCostCalcsMAP.Project;

